* NeoVim Setup

** Additionals
   ~ Install `gh`
   @code bash
brew install gh
# or
sudo dnf install -y gh
   @end
   
   ~ Install `luarocks` and `ticktoken_core`
   @code bash
sudo luarocks install --lua-version 5.4 tiktoken_core
   @end

